#### Do you want to try African drumming classes on the Sunshine Coast? This winter we have a little special to warm you up! Throughout June will be offering all NEW students in Maroochydore and Noosa the chance to come a try a class for $10! and if you LIKE what we do and join up for July 14th/July 16th classes we will be offering you a further 10% discount off the special reduced rate of $79! Yes, that's $66 for a 5 week course starting in July. Be sure to grab this awesome winter special! Drumming keeps you fit, warm and smiling....what have you got to lose!?
